    <bpmn:process id="W_W2492" name="W2492. Credit Hold Order Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer on credit hold attempts to place order
Frequency: ~100–200 credit hold orders/month
Volume: ~100–200/month
Owner: Order Management System / Credit Analyst
Participants: OMS, Credit Analyst, Trade Account Mgr, Customer
Source: workflow W2492 — Credit Hold Order Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2492_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2492_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2492_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2492_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2492_End5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2492_Start3" name="Customer on credit hold attempts to place order">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2492_Flow8</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2492_Task4" name="System blocks order; notifies Trade Account Manager and Credit Analyst; Analyst…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System blocks order; notifies Trade Account Manager and Credit Analyst; Analyst evaluates: partial release (up to available credit), conditional release (with payment commitment), or full hold; overrides logged for audit
Responsible (R): System / Credit Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 15–30 min per hold</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2492_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2492_End5" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2492_Flow9</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2492_Annotation6">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-434 (ensure controlled execution — Credit Limit Management &amp; Monitoring (PA-68.2).) | - CTL-434 (credit-authorization — links to VS-16 / W24); Operational: Order Management System / Credit Analyst sign-off on the workflow output
Owner: Order Management System / Credit Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2492_Assoc7" sourceRef="W2492_Annotation6" targetRef="W2492_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
